      "deviations": [
        "String paths only; URL/Buffer paths and public fd operations deferred.",
        "Synchronous WASI IO; callbacks deferred through real private next-tick FIFO, promises settle from synchronous operations; no background IO claim.",
        "Stats exposes only actual descriptor type predicates, size/nlink and host-provided atime/mtime/ctime. Unavailable POSIX mode/dev/ino/uid/gid/birthtime and absent optional timestamps are absent/undefined, with no getters or fabricated values.",
        "ReadStream uses one native descriptor, autoClose/emitClose true, flags r, inclusive start/end, highWaterMark1..65536, total64MiB; fd stays null and open event argument null, not a public OS fd.",
        "Fixed U8/Buffer data or UTF8/hex strings; read r, write w/wx, default modes only, no durable fsync/flush promise.",
        "All57 pinned Node22 constants are plain readable numeric guest-profile ABI symbols. They do not assert host OS values or confer WASI rights. Unsupported flags are rejected at operation invocation; inspection/JSON does not throw.",
        "Direct preopens constrain capability traversal; no libc cached-preopen table, raw memory or custom host service.",
        "No recursive readdir, watch, general async fd/FileHandle, write streams, chmod, symlink creation, copyFile/rm or stream inheritance expansion."
      ]
